notes:
The page names no related kill chain on csoh.org. These six are the related defense topics it links: AWS security, IAM and cloud identity, non-human identity, cloud data security, detection engineering, and incident response.

IAM stands for identity and access management. A non-human identity is one used by software rather than a person, such as the vendor's IAM users and the integration roles in this chain.
